  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing marine hypoxia in the Bay of Bengal Large Marine Ecosystem by reducing land-based agricultural pollution in the north-west of Sri Lanka (PPG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce eutrophication-induced hypoxia in the BOBLME, by curbing land-based agricultural pollution in north-west Sri Lanka. It will address levels of nutrient rich pollution from agriculture, with a focus on irrigated paddy and aquaculture (shrimp farms)</narrative>
  </description>
